@startuml Sequence_Guru_Leaderboard
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2980B9
    ActorBorderColor #1B4F72
    LifeLineBorderColor #2980B9
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    ParticipantBorderColor #1B4F72
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    ParticipantFontColor #1B2631
    GroupBorderColor #B7950B
    GroupBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
}

actor "Guru" as Guru
boundary "Dashboard & Leaderboard\n(dashboard/index.blade.php)" as View
control "DashboardController" as Ctrl
entity "Model Transaksi\n(presensi, jurnal_mengajar)" as Model

title **SEQUENCE DIAGRAM - MELIHAT PERINGKAT DAN TOP SCORE GURU**

activate Guru
Guru -> View : 1: Buka dashboard / halaman utama
activate View
View -> Ctrl : 2: getLeaderboardTopScore()
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Model : 3: Ambil seluruh data transaksi guru "presensi, e-jurnal"
activate Model
Model --> Ctrl : 4: Return data transaksi presensi & e-jurnal
deactivate Model

Ctrl -> Ctrl : 5: Kalkulasi akumulasi perhitungan poin
Ctrl -> Ctrl : 6: Urutkan data guru berdasarkan skor tertinggi
Ctrl -> Ctrl : 7: Identifikasi posisi peringkat dan badge

Ctrl --> View : 8: Return view data peringkat & skor
deactivate Ctrl

View --> Guru : 9: Tampilkan papan peringkat "Leaderboard / Top Score"
View --> Guru : 10: Tampilkan card posisi ranking dan detail perolehan poin
Guru -> View : 11: Selesai melihat peringkat dan skor

deactivate View
deactivate Guru
@enduml
